history of <i>Analog/Astounding</i> is found at the end of this page.
During 1960, <i>Astounding</i> made a transition to its new
title, <i>Analog</i>.  The <i>Astounding</i> data
from 1934-1943, 1945, 1950 and 17 miscellaneous issues were
supplied by John Boston
(<a href="mailto:redacted@redacted.com">John Boston</a>).
The 1949, 1951-1960 data was supplied by <a href="mailto:redacted@redacted.com">Cary Thomas</a>,
who has made an
<a href="http://users.aol.com/oneirovox/psycho.html">Analog/Astounding index</a>
database available, covering 1948 to the present.
The Jul44, Jan46, May46, Aug-Dec46, Jan47, Aug47, Nov47, Jun48
